OL,3,GNEWSAFrom armour to Emmys: Meet the NI
OL,4,Acreatives bringing Westeros to life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA costume designer from Northern
OL,7,FIreland has said she's "absolutely
OL,8,Fthrilled" to be nominated in the
OL,9,FCreative Arts Emmy Awards.
OL,11,FLorna O Riordain is being recognised
OL,12,Ffor her work on HBO's A Knight of the
OL,13,FSeven Kingdoms.
OL,15,FA prequel to Game of Thrones, the
OL,16,Fseries is based on George RR Martin's
OL,17,Fthree novellas telling the story of Ser
OL,18,FDuncan the Tall and his squire Egg,
OL,19,Faffectionately referred to as 'Dunk and
OL,20,FEgg'.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
